{
  "uid": "ihui-ai-app-golden-signals",
  "title": "IHUI-AI 应用层黄金指标",
  "description": "应用进程自身的黄金信号:吞吐量 / 错误 / 时延 / 饱和度。立因(2026-10-19 覆盖率审计):http_requests_by_status(9285)、db_pool_*、business_cache_hit_ratio、process_*、sql_query_duration_seconds 等 66 族均有真实样本却从未上屏。本盘表达式逐条实测。低流量直方图(ai-service 侧)一律用 $__range 窗口做 increase,避免短窗 rate 出 NaN。",
  "tags": ["ihui-ai"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "API 总 QPS",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_by_status[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "QPS",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "API 总 QPS"
    },
    {
      "title": "5xx 占比",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_requests_by_status{status=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_by_status[$__range])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "description": "5xx 占比"
    },
