    {
      "title": "HTTP 请求速率",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 35
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "job={{job}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (method) (rate(http_requests_by_method[5m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "method={{method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 23,
      "description": "吞吐来自两个实测存在的计数器:A 是 http_requests_total 按 job 的 5 分钟速率(实测 api 约 0.43/s、ai-service 0),B 是 http_requests_by_method 按 method 的速率(实测 POST 0.29/s > GET 0.13/s > HEAD 0.007/s)。http_requests_total 上只有 ai-service 的序列带 method/handler 标签,api 的序列不带,所以方法维度改用 http_requests_by_method 补。"
    },
    {
      "title": "HTTP 耗时(P95 与平均)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 35
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[6h])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
